          "title": "You'll want to know: सराहना",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सराहना — sarāhnā — \"to commend, to praise\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सबने उसके काम को सराहा। sabne uske kām ko sarāhā. Everyone praised his work."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with ने (he or she …): उसने मेरे काम को सराहा, usne mere kām ko sarāhā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सराहना (sarāhnā) is a tadbhava, inherited from Sanskrit ślāghate, \"praises\" (CDIAL 12734)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
